onalised candles are final sale unless damaged.","candleCare":["Trim the wick to 5mm before every burn.","Allow the wax pool to reach the edges on the first burn (2–3 hours).","Never burn for more than 4 hours at a time.","Keep away from drafts, pets, and flammable materials.","Discontinue use when 1cm of wax remains."],"manufacturer":{"packedBy":"EvaraNest\\nHandmade in India","marketedBy":"EvaraNest — Luxury Handmade Candles & Gifting\\nIndia"}},"pages":[{"id":"page-about-us","path":"/pages/about-us","title":"About EvaraNest","body":"EvaraNest is a luxury handmade candle atelier crafting soy wax, beeswax and signature scent collections for everyday warmth and thoughtful gifting.\\n\\nEvery pour is made in small batches in India — clean ingredients, gift-ready packaging, and fragrances composed to feel personal."},{"id":"page-work-with-us","path":"/pages/work-with-us","title":"Work with Us","body":"We partner with stylists, event planners, and retailers who share a love for calm, scented spaces.\\n\\nWrite to us via Contact for collaborations, wholesale, or custom pours."},{"id":"page-candle-care","path":"/pages/candle-care","title":"Candle Care","body":"Trim the wick to 5mm before every burn.\\n\\nAllow the wax pool to reach the edges on the first burn (2–3 hours).\\n\\nNever burn for more than 4 hours at a time.\\n\\nKeep away from drafts, pets, and flammable materials.\\n\\nDiscontinue use when 1cm of wax remains."},{"id":"page-privacy","path":"/policies/privacy-policy","title":"Privacy Policy","body":"We collect only what we need to fulfil orders, improve the storefront, and support you — name, contact details, shipping address, and order history.\\n\\nWe do not sell personal data. Payment details are processed by our payment partner and are not stored on this site."},{"id":"page-terms","path":"/policies/terms-of-service","title":"Terms & Conditions","body":"By placing an order with EvaraNest you agree that product colours may vary slightly from screen to life, personalised items are final sale unless damaged, and delivery timelines are estimates subject to courier partners."},{"id":"page-contact","path":"/policies/contact-information","title":"Contact Us","body":"Reach us on WhatsApp for the fastest reply, or email hello@evaranest.in.\\n\\nWe typically respond within one business day."},{"id":"page-shipping","path":"/policies/shipping-policy","title":"Shipping Policy","body":"Orders leave our atelier within 1–2 business days.\\n\\nMetros usually arrive in 2–4 days; rest of India in 3–6 days.\\n\\nFree shipping applies on eligible prepaid & COD orders above the threshold shown on the storefront."},{"id":"page-refund","path":"/policies/refund-policy","title":"Refund Policy","body":"Unused items may be returned or exchanged within 7 days of delivery.\\n\\nPersonalised candles are final sale unless damaged in transit.\\n\\nApproved refunds are processed to the original payment method."}]}');
